<title>UK: UK's Tibbett expands presence in U.S..</title>
<headline>UK's Tibbett expands presence in U.S..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tibbett &amp; Britten Group said on Wednesday that its North American subsidiary has agreed in principle to buy or lease the distribution assets of U.S food retailer Safeway Inc in Tracy, California.</p>
<p>The transportation and distribution firm said the proposed transaction will involve minimal financial consideration.</p>
<p>The centre supplies grocery goods and other merchandise to more than 250 Safeway stores in Northern California, Nevada and Hawaii and employs around 1,400 people.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
